## Invariants
- Clear Ops changes write canonical state; preserve Done/Removed.
- Read full relevant Gmail; reconcile Shipments; retain Order Events; report delivery once.
- Important mail stays `Ops/Archive Approval`. Never auto-send email. Reject no-reply/unmonitored routes; find official support; show recipient+subject+full draft; ask `Do you want me to send this email?`.
- Carrier-only FedEx/UPS/DHL logistics mail may move to Trash only under the audited 90-day post-delivery retention rule; all other Gmail deletion needs bounded authority.
- HOME/ROAD uses live controls/trips. Home early closes mileage. Paid terminal miles are symmetric A↔B unless an explicit exception is recorded.
- Receipt email/photo/screenshot from a supported conversation enters canonical workflow when required authorities are reachable. Dedupe; no chat-local state; old chats may be deleted after ingestion.
- One purchase = one Receipt ID/total. Investigate UPC/SKU/part/model/serial against assets/mods; auto-assign unique supported identity/fitment; balance allocations; queue only after evidence is exhausted.
- People/assets/aliases, reimbursements, payment cases and calendar projections are Sheet state. Reimbursement != merchant refund; preserve gross purchase and net household cost.
- Reconcile same-order revisions before charges. Keep expected charges open until resolved; investigate unmatched/over/undercharges.
- Run sheets reconcile into existing Routes/Trips/Mileage; never create a duplicate route database.
- Gmail archival/success requires applicable Audit gate PASS.

